{
  "an3.80:0.1": "Numbered Discourses 3.80 ",
  "an3.80:0.2": "8. Ānanda ",
  "an3.80:0.3": "Lesser ",
  "an3.80:1.1": "Then Venerable Ānanda went up to the Buddha, bowed, sat down to one side, and said to him: ",
  "an3.80:1.2": "“Sir, I have heard and learned this in the presence of the Buddha: ",
  "an3.80:1.3": "‘Ānanda, the Buddha Sikhī had a disciple named Abhibhū. Standing in the realm of divinity, he could make his voice heard throughout the thousandfold galaxy.’ ",
  "an3.80:1.4": "I wonder how far a Blessed One, a perfected one, a fully awakened Buddha can make their voice heard?” ",
  "an3.80:1.5": "“He was a disciple, Ānanda. Realized Ones are immeasurable.” ",
  "an3.80:2.1": "For a second time … ",
  "an3.80:2.2": "",
  "an3.80:2.3": "",
  "an3.80:2.4": "",
  "an3.80:2.5": "",
  "an3.80:3.1": "For a third time, Ānanda said to the Buddha: ",
  "an3.80:3.2": "",
  "an3.80:3.3": "",
  "an3.80:3.4": "“… I wonder how far a Blessed One, a perfected one, a fully awakened Buddha can make their voice heard?” ",
  "an3.80:3.5": "“Ānanda, have you heard of a thousandfold lesser world system, a galaxy?” ",
  "an3.80:3.6": "“Now is the time, Blessed One! Now is the time, Holy One! ",
  "an3.80:3.7": "Let the Buddha speak. The mendicants will listen and remember it.” ",
  "an3.80:3.8": "“Well then, Ānanda, listen and apply your mind well, I will speak.” ",
  "an3.80:3.9": "“Yes, sir,” Ānanda replied. ",
  "an3.80:3.10": "The Buddha said this: ",
  "an3.80:4.1": "�